# Project: Sadiq's Portfolio

## Stack
- Frontend: React
- Backend: Node.js, Express, MongoDB
- Deployment: Netlify

## Conventions
- Commit format: Conventional Commits (feat, fix, docs, chore, style, refactor)
- Code style: [your preference]
- Branch naming: feature/*, fix/*

## Purpose
Portfolio site proving I can build working full-stack e-commerce/ordering flows (see: Zaiqa Express, Sasha Mart, Sadiq Real Estate). One action: get visitors to contact me.
